&lt;li&gt;Execute various animation styles (frame-by-frame, motion graphics, etc.), showcasing your keen eye for detail and impeccable timing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and animate using motion graphics principles to enhance the appeal of collectibles and user interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with game publishers, designers, and vendors to produce polished, high-quality animations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within technical product constraints to ensure animations are both visually stunning and performant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple projects simultaneously, adapting to shifting priorities and deadlines while maintaining quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide thoughtful feedback on the work of peers and vendors to elevate creative output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a portfolio showcasing advanced animation skills, including frame-by-frame work, motion graphics, and a variety of styles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 6+ years of animation experience, ideally in the tech or gaming industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an expert in 2D animation techniques, with a strong understanding of motion principles, composition, and timing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in industry-standard animation software such as Adobe After Effects, Toon Boom Harmony, Adobe Animate, and TV Paint. Bonus: Experience with Lottie, Rive, or Figma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work effectively with artists, designers, and other team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can present creative concepts confidently and articulate the reasoning behind design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are receptive to constructive feedback and can iterate on designs to achieve the desired outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are team-oriented, humble, and bring a positive attitude to your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with 3D software such as Cinema 4D, Maya, or Blender.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UX animation tools like Rive and Lottie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with illustration tools and techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
