&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an impact-focused Staff Engineer to join our world-class Revenue group as an E-commerce specialist as we accelerate Discord’s growth by enabling sophisticated e-commerce browsing and content promotion experiences. These product lines allow us to grow our business while keeping Discord’s core functionality free. To learn more about Discord Engineering, take a look at our &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.discord.com/tagged/engineering&quot;&gt;engineering blog!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical leader and domain expert on e-commerce product catalog data modeling that will enable us to build world-class shopping experiences, content recommendations, and promotions that serve low latency content to our Shop UIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a strategic partner with engineering, product, and cross functional leadership to advise and chart out pathways to scaling revenue operations and business lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Design, CX, Data Science, and feature teams across the company to evolve Discord’s commerce platform and expand its capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide feature teams with tools and platform support needed to spin up new monetization products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the reliability, observability, and stability of Discord’s commerce systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
